# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Atraxa, Grand Unifier's enter trigger reveals ten cards and offers one card per card type to hand.
# Forcing: Atraxa is castable from hand; the top ten library cards cover six card types.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no permanents or hand, so it makes no decisions.
# Card roles:
#   Atraxa, Grand Unifier — the trigger under test.
#   Sol Ring, Llanowar Elves, Opt, Divination, Pacifism, Island — one card per type in the top ten.
# Protocol path: cast, resolution, enter trigger, type choice, card choice, library to hand.

[metadata]
